# Keep the audit tooling out of GitHub's language statistics.
#
# This repository's substance is ServiceNow configuration: a scoped
# application exported as update-set XML. The Python under tools/ is
# supporting automation that checks that XML, not the work itself.
#
# Without this rule those few hundred lines win the language badge, and a
# ServiceNow access-control portfolio piece advertises itself as a Python
# project to anyone scanning the profile.
#
# linguist-detectable=false removes them from the language bar only. The
# files stay fully visible, diffable, searchable and executable.

tools/* linguist-detectable=false
